    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169810/extras/11ba7fb5d22054aece0774f20e0d1477.avif?t=1753754734\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I am just an ordinary, sunny and handsome young man, but unexpectedly met two charming and beautiful sisters at the corner of life - Kello and Cammy. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They are both mature, elegant and beautiful. A different kind of feeling quietly arises among the three of them... How to choose? I think this is undoubtedly a sweet adventure...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169810/extras/5d72042ffe9a2eb627c0c9d09e2804f8.avif?t=1753754734\" width=598 height=358 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You will experience</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kylo and Camilla</strong> two more complete story lines</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>interaction with female character portraits,</strong>scene interaction, and Japanese dubbing of all plot dialogues! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exquisite color illustrations</strong>, each scene and character has been carefully designed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Older female characters</strong>, two mature and charming big sisters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful background music</strong>, accompanied by melodious background music, your story is about to begin...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interesting elimination game</strong>, simple and easy-to-use elimination gameplay, easily brings a pleasant gaming experience</p></li></ul><